  "descriptionHtml": "<p data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"828\">Promote your message effectively with our <strong data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"572\">Full Color Custom Yard Sign</strong>, a durable and professional solution for outdoor advertising, real estate, events, and political or business promotions. Printed in <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"719\">full color</strong> on rigid <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"746\">4mm coroplast</strong>, this yard sign delivers vibrant visuals while standing up to outdoor conditions.</p>\n<p data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"1090\">Each sign measures <strong data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"862\">24\u201d \u00d7 18\u201d</strong> and comes <strong data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"889\">ready to use</strong>, including <strong data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"917\">metal stakes</strong>, <strong data-start=\"919\" data-end=\"941\">professional setup</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"976\">delivery at no extra cost</strong>. Designed for quick installation, it\u2019s an easy and affordable way to get your message in front of customers fast.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1115\">\ud83d\udd39 Key Features</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1117\" data-end=\"1530\">\ud83e\udea7 <strong data-start=\"1120\" data-end=\"1150\">Full Color Custom Printing</strong> \u2013 High-quality, vibrant graphics<br data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1186\">\ud83d\udccf <strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1206\">Standard Size</strong> \u2013 24\" \u00d7 18\" yard sign<br data-start=\"1228\" data-end=\"1231\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1254\">Durable Material</strong> \u2013 4mm corrugated coroplast<br data-start=\"1281\" data-end=\"1284\">\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"1288\" data-end=\"1305\">Outdoor Ready</strong> \u2013 Weather-resistant for long-term use<br data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1346\">\ud83d\udd29 <strong data-start=\"1349\" data-end=\"1374\">Metal Stakes Included</strong> \u2013 Easy ground installation<br data-start=\"1401\" data-end=\"1404\">\ud83c\udfa8 <strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1434\">Design &amp; Setup Included</strong> \u2013 No additional setup fees<br data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1464\">\ud83d\ude9a <strong data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1488\">Delivery Included</strong> \u2013 Hassle-free shipping to your location</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1537\" data-end=\"1557\">\ud83d\udd39 Imprint Method</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1589\">\ud83d\udda8\ufe0f Full-Color Digital Printing</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1596\" data-end=\"1611\">\ud83d\udd39 Materials</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1665\">\ud83e\uddf1 Sign Material: 4mm Coroplast<br data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1647\">\ud83d\udd29 Stakes: Metal</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1693\">\ud83d\udd39 What\u2019s Included</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1790\">\ud83d\udce6 Full Color Custom Yard Sign (24\u00d718)<br data-start=\"1736\" data-end=\"1739\">\ud83d\udd29 Metal Stake<br data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1759\">\ud83c\udfa8 Design Setup<br data-start=\"1774\" data-end=\"1777\">\ud83d\ude9a Delivery</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1797\" data-end=\"1816\">\ud83d\udd39 Primary Usage</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1953\">Outdoor advertising, real estate signage, events, political campaigns, business promotions, construction sites, and directional signage.</p>\n<h2 data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1953\"><span size=\"2\"><span>Warranty</span></span></h2>\n<section id=\"shopify-section---19178971496583__main-product\" class=\"shopify-section product-info-wrap\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<div id=\"ProductPage---19178971496583__main-product\" data-section-id=\"--19178971496583__main-product\" class=\"product product-page\">\n<div class=\"product-info-description\">\n<div class=\"product-info-description-content\">\n<div class=\"facet\">\n<div class=\"facet-content rte\">\n<p>We stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>",
  "descriptionText": "Promote your message effectively with our Full Color Custom Yard Sign, a durable and professional solution for outdoor advertising, real estate, events, and political or business promotions. Printed in full color on rigid 4mm coroplast, this yard sign delivers vibrant visuals while standing up to outdoor conditions.\nEach sign measures 24\u201d \u00d7 18\u201d and comes ready to use, including metal stakes, professional setup, and delivery at no extra cost. Designed for quick installation, it\u2019s an easy and affordable way to get your message in front of customers fast.\n\ud83d\udd39 Key Features\n\ud83e\udea7 Full Color Custom Printing \u2013 High-quality, vibrant graphics\n\ud83d\udccf Standard Size \u2013 24\" \u00d7 18\" yard sign\n\ud83e\uddf1 Durable Material \u2013 4mm corrugated coroplast\n\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Outdoor Ready \u2013 Weather-resistant for long-term use\n\ud83d\udd29 Metal Stakes Included \u2013 Easy ground installation\n\ud83c\udfa8 Design & Setup Included \u2013 No additional setup fees\n\ud83d\ude9a Delivery Included \u2013 Hassle-free shipping to your location\n\ud83d\udd39 Imprint Method\n\ud83d\udda8\ufe0f Full-Color Digital Printing\n\ud83d\udd39 Materials\n\ud83e\uddf1 Sign Material: 4mm Coroplast\n\ud83d\udd29 Stakes: Metal\n\ud83d\udd39 What\u2019s Included\n\ud83d\udce6 Full Color Custom Yard Sign (24\u00d718)\n\ud83d\udd29 Metal Stake\n\ud83c\udfa8 Design Setup\n\ud83d\ude9a Delivery\n\ud83d\udd39 Primary Usage\nOutdoor advertising, real estate signage, events, political campaigns, business promotions, construction sites, and directional signage.\nWarranty\nWe stand behind the quality of our products. Our warranty covers any factory defects or damage that occurs during shipping. However, please note that we do not cover damage resulting from extreme weather conditions, misuse, or any circumstances beyond our control.",
